Subject: [PATCH] nbapi: reconcile TID queue rows without periodic object churn

Keep native per-TID instance identities stable across reports. Update changed
queue sizes and add or remove only keys that actually appear or disappear.
Initialize unique TID and Size together in one transaction. This avoids the
remove/add/count event flood at full-roster one-second metrics cadence without
discarding native metrics or changing the reporting interval.

